  "description": "Operating Area:  Italy, Amalfi Coast, Sardinia, Pontine Islands, Tuscany, Sicily & Aeolian Islands, Liguria & Cinque Terre\n\nBLUE EYES is an Azimut Magellano 25M from Azimut’s acclaimed Magellano explorer series, combining long-range cruising capability with refined Italian design and exceptional onboard livability. \n\nThe interior features a light, modern aesthetic with soft marine tones and clean architectural lines. Large panoramic windows flood the main deck with natural light, enhancing the sense of volume and openness throughout the living spaces. \n\nBLUE EYES accommodates up to 9 guests in 4 well-appointed cabins, all with en suite bathrooms and generous storage. The layout comprises 1 Master Cabin, 1 VIP Cabin, 1 Convertible Cabin and 1 Twin Cabin with Pullman bed. Each cabin offers a calm, private atmosphere designed for relaxation during both short stays and extended cruises.\n\nFor enhanced comfort, BLUE EYES is equipped with stabilizers both at anchor and underway, significantly reducing roll and ensuring a smooth and enjoyable experience whether cruising or at rest.\n\nA professional and experienced crew of four is dedicated to delivering seamless service on board. ",
